.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
This buffer implementation has four stages:
- No data
- Bytes-based buffer
- BytesIO-based buffer
- Temporary file storage
The first two stages are fastest for simple transfers\&.

.fi
.PP
 
